{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:8c99504c1da3d8b8","name":"Sith Commander Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-8c99504c1da3d8b8","title":"Sith Commander Talent Tree","revision":20307,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:36:24Z","sha256":"aba0c340fc875a9516900ddb7e872b2f363d46db695d0f7b40630b9d4955c24f","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20307","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Sith%20Commander%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-8c99504c1da3d8b8","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["The Sith"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sith","referenceId":"reference:32bde5e69837ac8e"}," use terror to lead their troops, and Sith Commanders have few compunctions about making examples of underlings. Therefore, it is not surprising that ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Sith"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sith","referenceId":"reference:32bde5e69837ac8e"}," use anger and fear of their subordinates to their own terrible advantage.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Desperate Measures"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Focus Terror"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Desperation stems from fear. Once per encounter as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", you can instill desperation in all allies within 12 squares of you and in your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"},", allowing each of them to make an immediate attack at a -5 penalty.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Focus Terror"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Once per encounter as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", you can harness the fear felt by your allies and transform it into a powerful motivational tool. All allies within 12 squares of you and in your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," move +2 steps along the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},", but suffer a -2 penalty on attack rolls and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Checks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Checks"}," for a number of rounds equal to your Character Level.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Incite Rage"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Once per encounter as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", you can channel your anger and hatred into your allies. All allies within 12 squares of you and in your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," gain a +1 Rage bonus on attack rolls, but take a -2 penalty to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},". This effect lasts until the encounter ends, or until you are knocked unconscious or killed.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Power of Hatred"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Incite Rage"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Once per encounter as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", you can inflame the passions of your allies. Each ally within your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," who has fewer than half its normal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"}," gains ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bonus Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bonus_Hit_Points"}," equal to your Character Level. Damage is subtracted from the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bonus Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bonus_Hit_Points"}," first, and any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bonus Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bonus_Hit_Points"}," remaining at the end of the encounter go away. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bonus Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bonus_Hit_Points"}," from multiple sources do not stack.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
